WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.510
Follow food from field
to plate: growing it,

2
00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.510
catching it, processing
it, selling it, cooking it.

3
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:12.570
The FAO studies this work from production
to distribution and consumption.

4
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:16.750
In some regions, food work is the
main employer for working women.

5
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.150
In others, it is only a
minority of their jobs.

6
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.530
So why is food work the main job for
most working women in some regions,

7
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.010
but not in others?

8
00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:31.370
In this mission, you'll compare regions
using data on women's and men's jobs.

9
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.650
Then you'll see who feeds the household,
and the unequal conditions many women

10
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:36.970
face.

11
00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:42.030
Your mission: explain why food work
dominates women's jobs in some regions but

12
00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.000
not others.
